  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Slice the onion and bell peppers into thin rounds.",
    "3. Place the onion and bell peppers on a baking sheet, drizzle with a little oil and roast for 20 minutes.",
    "4. While the vegetables are roasting, form the beef burgers and season with salt and pepper.",
    "5. Grill the beef burgers in a preheated oven for 4-5 minutes per side for medium-rare.",
    "6. Meanwhile, toast the Slovakian bread rolls on the grill or in the oven.",
    "7. Assemble the burgers with the roasted vegetables, cheese, and a dollop of butter on the bun.",
    "8. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
